Hallo Herr Kroll,

thanks for the call today. To summarise what we agreed for the TX-44 rollout
in plants 2, 3 and 5:

- rev C firmware from the first production lot
- full rev C command set as in your preliminary protocol document v0.9
  (multi-point calibration, 4-channel config, events, firmware update over
  the bus). Our integrator (Rauhut Automation) will implement against that
  list, we cannot do a second integration round
- firmware update over LB2 is a must, we will not open 240 housings in an
  ATEX zone for updates

Please confirm the command list is final by end of next week so Rauhut can
start. Delivery of the first 80 heads as discussed.

